{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026d3X3iAfqyl1795174910.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港澳辦主任夏寶龍在深圳調研香港中文大學(深圳)。</p><p></p><p>夏寶龍上午在香港中文大學(深圳)，聽取校長徐揚生情況介紹後，肯定學校的辦學方向，希望學校繼續發揮獨特優勢，更好服務粵港澳大灣區建設。港澳辦分管日常工作的副主任徐啟方，副主任農融，教育局局長蔡若蓮亦有參加。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:43:56.060685+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T01:57:19.892496+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T12:37:17.306714+00:00","content_hash":"621508beb6513bc5affe54e9e08eb2c7e11922042a0b933b70aa340264cc2c05","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:43:56.060685+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}